.TH DOTFILES 7 "2026-07-17" "dotfiles" "Dotfiles Reference"
.SH NAME
dotfiles \- personal system configuration reference
.SH DESCRIPTION
Quick reference for which config file controls what in this dotfiles setup.
All config files live in
.B ~/.dotfiles/
and are symlinked to their expected locations.
.P
Cross-platform: macOS (Homebrew) and Arch Linux (pacman).
.
.SH CONFIGURATION FILES
All paths are relative to
.BR ~/.dotfiles/ .
.P
.TS
box tab(|);
cb | cb
l | l .
Setting|Config File
=
Terminal|ghostty/config
Editor|nvim/
Shell|zsh/zshrc
Login Shell (PATH)|zsh/zprofile
Local Overrides|~/.zshrc.local
Multiplexer|tmux/tmux.conf
Git|git/gitconfig
Git Email (per-machine)|~/.gitconfig.local
Man Page|man/dotfiles.7
Window Manager (Linux)|hyprland/hyprland.conf
Status Bar (Linux)|waybar/config.jsonc + style.css
App Launcher (Linux)|rofi/config.rasi
Power Menu (Linux)|rofi/powermenu.sh
Notifications (Linux)|dunst/dunstrc
Wallpaper (Linux)|~/.config/hypr/hyprpaper.conf
Lock Screen (Linux)|~/.config/hypr/hyprlock.conf
.TE
.
.SH SYMLINKS
Created by
.B install.sh
\(em maps repo files to where the system expects them.
.P
.TS
box tab(|);
cb | cb | cb
l | l | l .
Repository Source|Symlink Target|Platform
=
nvim/|~/.config/nvim|All
tmux/tmux.conf|~/.tmux.conf|All
zsh/zshrc|~/.zshrc|All
zsh/zprofile|~/.zprofile|All
git/gitconfig|~/.gitconfig|All
git/gitignore_global|~/.gitignore_global|All
ghostty/|~/.config/ghostty|All
hyprland/|~/.config/hypr|Linux
waybar/|~/.config/waybar|Linux
rofi/|~/.config/rofi|Linux
dunst/|~/.config/dunst|Linux
man/dotfiles.7|~/.local/share/man/man7/dotfiles.7|Linux
.TE
.
.SH LIVE REFERENCE
Keybindings are intentionally not copied into this man page, so it cannot
drift from the active configuration.
.TP
.B Neovim
Press Space for which-key groups, ? for buffer-local mappings, or use
.BR :map .
.TP
.B tmux
Run
.B tmux list-keys
inside a session.
.TP
.B Hyprland
Run
.B hyprctl binds
or consult
.BR docs/rice-guide.md .
.
.SH EDITING CONFIGURATIONS
To edit a config, open the file in Neovim and reload:
.P
.RS 4
.nf
nvim ~/.dotfiles/hyprland/hyprland.conf
hyprctl reload
.fi
.RE
.P
Waybar requires a restart:
.P
.RS 4
.nf
killall waybar && waybar &
.fi
.RE
.
.SH FILES
.TP
.B ~/.dotfiles/
Repository root (all configs)
.TP
.B ~/.dotfiles/install.sh
Installer script (cross-platform). Flags: --update (skip prompts), --config-only (remote servers)
.TP
.B ~/.dotfiles/README.md
Repository overview and installation instructions
.TP
.B ~/.dotfiles/docs/neovim-details.md
Neovim architecture, tooling, and plugin reference
.TP
.B ~/.dotfiles/docs/vanilla-vim-guide.md
Native Vim alternatives guide
.TP
.B ~/.dotfiles/docs/rice-guide.md
Hyprland rice setup tutorial
.
.SH AUTHOR
Managed with dotfiles.
